{"id":"wb-6-304","name":"日坛","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"日坛","text":"日坛位于北京城东部，在今朝阳区建国门地区，周围有使馆区。是中华人民共和国国家3A级旅游景区、全国重点文物保护单位。日坛是中国古代皇帝祭祀太阳的地方，又称“朝日坛”（与“夕月坛”相对）。今为日坛公园。\n与日坛相对的月坛位于北京城西部的阜成门附近。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%97%A5%E5%9D%9B","revisionId":93976190,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93976190","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c9ab769d99539fb8d178c24f.jpg","title":"West_Holy_Gate_(Temple_of_the_Sun).JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:West_Holy_Gate_(Temple_of_the_Sun).JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/West_Holy_Gate_%28Temple_of_the_Sun%29.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Dirrival","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​北京日坛西天门","width":320,"height":240}}